  "description": "Create Jet 4 MDB fixture with table T (ID LONG CONSTRAINT PK PRIMARY KEY, V LONG, W TEXT(50)) where V already has Description ('Value column') and Format ('#,##0') properties. Keeps whole file after creation.",
  "createsFixture": true,
